{
  "version": 1,
  "tools": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "search_notes",
        "description": "用途：在学生个人知识库里做混合检索，返回可引用的笔记片段；需要「笔记里怎么说的」或为答案找依据时用。参数 query 为检索问题，可用 subject_id/folder/start_date/end_date/chunk_types 限定范围，top_k 取 1–20 条，retrieval 可选 vector/hybrid/hybrid_rerank。返回带 note_id、标题、页码与正文片段的命中列表（正文超过 1200 字会截断）。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "query": {
              "maxLength": 500,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Query",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "subject_id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Subject Id"
            },
            "folder": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "maxLength": 200,
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Folder"
            },
            "start_date": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "format": "date",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Start Date"
            },
            "end_date": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "format": "date",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "End Date"
            },
            "chunk_types": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "items": {
                    "enum": [
                      "question",
                      "note",
                      "formula"
                    ],
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "maxItems": 3,
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "type": "array"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Chunk Types"
            },
            "top_k": {
              "default": 8,
              "maximum": 20,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Top K",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "retrieval": {
              "default": "hybrid",
              "enum": [
                "vector",
                "hybrid",
                "hybrid_rerank"
              ],
              "title": "Retrieval",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "query"
          ],
          "title": "SearchNotesIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "list_notes",
        "description": "用途：按时间范围/标签/学科列出本人笔记的元数据，用于「上周写了哪些笔记」。参数 start_date/end_date 为 ISO 日期（含当天），tags 最多 10 个，limit 取 1–50。只返回标题、标签、文件夹与时间，不返回正文；需要正文时改用 search_notes。多个标签时先按第一个标签分页再在内存过滤，filtered_total 可能小于 total。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "start_date": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "format": "date",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Start Date"
            },
            "end_date": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "format": "date",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "End Date"
            },
            "tags": {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "title": "Tags",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "subject_id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Subject Id"
            },
            "limit": {
              "default": 20,
              "maximum": 50,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Limit",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "title": "ListNotesIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "get_kp_subgraph",
        "description": "用途：取一个知识点及其 N 跳前置/相关/包含关系，用于聚类、导图或薄弱点分析；只返回已审核的图谱边。参数 kp_id 是中心知识点，depth 取 1–3（默认 1）。返回中心点、学科、节点（含本人掌握度，未评估为 null）与边（src/dst/relation/weight）。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "kp_id": {
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Kp Id",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "depth": {
              "default": 1,
              "maximum": 3,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Depth",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kp_id"
          ],
          "title": "GetKpSubgraphIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "list_mistakes",
        "description": "用途：按知识点/状态/时间筛选本人错题；用于「最近错了哪些」「按薄弱知识点聚合」。参数 kp_ids 最多 20 个，status 可选待订正/已订正/已掌握，start_date/end_date 为 ISO 日期（含当天），limit 取 1–50。返回错题摘要（题干片段、状态、题型、难度、知识点、错因），不返回答案与作答正文。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "kp_ids": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "maxItems": 20,
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "type": "array"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Kp Ids"
            },
            "status": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "enum": [
                    "待订正",
                    "已订正",
                    "已掌握"
                  ],
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Status"
            },
            "start_date": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "format": "date",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Start Date"
            },
            "end_date": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "format": "date",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "End Date"
            },
            "limit": {
              "default": 20,
              "maximum": 50,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Limit",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "title": "ListMistakesIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "get_mastery",
        "description": "用途：批量查询本人知识点的有效掌握度 M_t 与复习到期时间，作为组卷/复习推荐的依据。参数 kp_ids 为 1–50 个知识点 id。返回每条知识点的 M_t（未评估为 null）、attempts/stability/due_at，并区分未评估与不存在的 id。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "kp_ids": {
              "items": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "maxItems": 50,
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Kp Ids",
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kp_ids"
          ],
          "title": "GetMasteryIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "search_questions",
        "description": "用途：按知识点/题型/难度从公共题库取题干，供组卷取材或定位变式题源题；不返回答案。参数 kp_ids 最多 20 个，qtype 可选单选/多选/填空/解答，difficulty 取 1–5，exclude_recent_days 排除本人近 N 天做过的题（0 表示不排除），limit 取 1–50。返回每题题干（超 2000 字截断）、选项、题型、难度、来源与知识点，已验证题目排在前面。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "kp_ids": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "maxItems": 20,
                  "minItems": 1,
                  "type": "array"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Kp Ids"
            },
            "subject_id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Subject Id"
            },
            "qtype": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "enum": [
                    "单选",
                    "多选",
                    "填空",
                    "解答"
                  ],
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Qtype"
            },
            "difficulty": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "maximum": 5,
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Difficulty"
            },
            "exclude_recent_days": {
              "default": 14,
              "maximum": 90,
              "minimum": 0,
              "title": "Exclude Recent Days",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "limit": {
              "default": 20,
              "maximum": 50,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Limit",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "title": "SearchQuestionsIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "generate_questions",
        "description": "用途：题库不足时按知识点与难度生成新题草稿；只返回候选，不入库，需人工确认后才可保存。参数 kp_id 指定知识点，difficulty 取 1–5，count 取 1–5，qtype 可选单选/多选/填空/解答。返回题目草稿（题干/选项/答案/解析/题型/难度）、Prompt 版本与实际调用次数。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "kp_id": {
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Kp Id",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "difficulty": {
              "default": 3,
              "maximum": 5,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Difficulty",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "count": {
              "default": 3,
              "maximum": 5,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Count",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "qtype": {
              "default": "解答",
              "enum": [
                "单选",
                "多选",
                "填空",
                "解答"
              ],
              "title": "Qtype",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kp_id"
          ],
          "title": "GenerateQuestionsIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "make_mindmap",
        "description": "用途：把知识点节点与关系转成 Mermaid 思维导图文本，并附带纯文本结构降级。参数 title 是导图标题，nodes 至少 1 个（id/name/parent_id），edges 可选（src/dst/relation）。返回 mermaid（树合法时为 mindmap，否则为 graph TD）、fallback_text、node_count/edge_count 与 truncated。",
        "parameters": {
          "$defs": {
            "MindmapEdge": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "src": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  ],
                  "title": "Src"
                },
                "dst": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  ],
                  "title": "Dst"
                },
                "relation": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "default": null,
                  "title": "Relation"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "src",
                "dst"
              ],
              "title": "MindmapEdge",
              "type": "object"
            },
            "MindmapNode": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "integer"
                    }
                  ],
                  "title": "Id"
                },
                "name": {
                  "maxLength": 80,
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "title": "Name",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "parent_id": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "default": null,
                  "title": "Parent Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "id",
                "name"
              ],
              "title": "MindmapNode",
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "title": {
              "default": "思维导图",
              "maxLength": 100,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Title",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "nodes": {
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/MindmapNode"
              },
              "maxItems": 80,
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Nodes",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "edges": {
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/MindmapEdge"
              },
              "maxItems": 160,
              "title": "Edges",
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "nodes"
          ],
          "title": "MakeMindmapIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "create_review_plan",
        "description": "用途：给一批知识点排未来 N 天的复习计划建议；只返回计划，不写库。参数 kp_ids 为 1–30 个知识点，days 取 1–14。按掌握度从低到高轮转分配到各天（第一天为本地明天），每项 6 分钟，返回逐项优先级/日期/理由与每日汇总；未评估知识点排在最后并提示先做练习。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "kp_ids": {
              "items": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "maxItems": 30,
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Kp Ids",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "days": {
              "default": 3,
              "maximum": 14,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Days",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kp_ids"
          ],
          "title": "CreateReviewPlanIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "export_paper_pdf",
        "description": "用途：为已保存试卷生成受权校验后的下载地址；供错题组卷任务的最后一步使用。参数 paper_id 是本人试卷 id，variant 选 questions（题干卷）或 answers（答案卷）。返回题目数、总分、文件名与 /api/v1/papers/{id}/export.pdf 下载地址；工具不渲染 PDF，真正下载仍走既有导出接口。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "paper_id": {
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Paper Id",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "variant": {
              "default": "questions",
              "enum": [
                "questions",
                "answers"
              ],
              "title": "Variant",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "paper_id"
          ],
          "title": "ExportPaperPdfIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "calculator",
        "description": "用途：对算术表达式求值，避免心算错误。参数 expression 只支持数字、括号、+ - * / // % ** 与一元正负号，不接受变量或函数。返回 value（浮点）、text（12 位有效数字）与 exact（是否为整数）。",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "expression": {
              "maxLength": 200,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Expression",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "expression"
          ],
          "title": "CalculatorIn",
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputs": {
    "search_notes": {
      "$defs": {
        "SearchNoteHit": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "chunk_id": {
              "title": "Chunk Id",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "note_id": {
              "title": "Note Id",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "note_title": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Note Title"
            },
            "chunk_index": {
              "title": "Chunk Index",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "chunk_type": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Chunk Type"
            },
            "heading_path": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Heading Path"
            },
            "page_no": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Page No"
            },
            "content": {
              "title": "Content",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "snippet": {
              "title": "Snippet",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "truncated": {
              "title": "Truncated",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "rrf_score": {
              "title": "Rrf Score",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "rerank_score": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Rerank Score"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "chunk_id",
            "note_id",
            "chunk_index",
            "content",
            "snippet",
            "truncated",
            "rrf_score"
          ],
          "title": "SearchNoteHit",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "query": {
          "title": "Query",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "retrieval": {
          "title": "Retrieval",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "top_k": {
          "title": "Top K",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "hit_count": {
          "title": "Hit Count",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "elapsed_ms": {
          "title": "Elapsed Ms",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "embedding_ms": {
          "title": "Embedding Ms",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "hits": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/SearchNoteHit"
          },
          "title": "Hits",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "query",
        "retrieval",
        "top_k",
        "hit_count",
        "elapsed_ms",
        "embedding_ms",
        "hits"
      ],
      "title": "SearchNotesOut",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "list_notes": {
      "$defs": {
        "NoteBrief": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "note_id": {
              "title": "Note Id",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "title": {
              "title": "Title",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "subject_id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Subject Id"
            },
            "tags": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "type": "array"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Tags"
            },
            "folder": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Folder"
            },
            "created_at": {
              "format": "date-time",
              "title": "Created At",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "updated_at": {
              "format": "date-time",
              "title": "Updated At",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "note_id",
            "title",
            "created_at",
            "updated_at"
          ],
          "title": "NoteBrief",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "total": {
          "title": "Total",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "filtered_total": {
          "title": "Filtered Total",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "items": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/NoteBrief"
          },
          "title": "Items",
